        "source_note": "Li et al. report a new absolute 300 K MgO BM3 pressure scale, not a direct pressure-volume BM3 regression. Its conventional-cell V0 is measured by XRD; its isothermal K0 and K0' follow exactly from the preferred decompression acoustic finite-strain fit and the printed Equation 4 conversion.",
        "audit": "../audits/mgo.audit.json#mgo_li_2006_bm3_absolute_acoustic"
      },
      "model": "BM3",
      "temperature_ref": 300.0,
      "parameters": {
